Get document information
post
https://api.icount.co.il/api/v3.php/doc/info
Request
Body

application/json

cid
string
Company identifier

user
string
Username

pass
string
Password

doctype
string
required
Document type

docnum
integer
required
Document number

get_items
boolean
Get items.

Default:
true
get_payments
boolean
Get payment information.

Default:
true
get_custom_info
boolean
Get custom fields for document.

Default:
true
get_autoinvoices
boolean
Get autoinvoices (for doctype=receipt only).

Default:
false
get_base_doc_url
boolean
Get base document URL.

Default:
false
get_doctype_info
boolean
Get document type information.

Default:
false
get_pdf_link
boolean
Get direct link to document PDF.

Default:
false
get_paynow_link
boolean
Get PayNow (self-payment page) URL for invoice/deal

get_conversion_options
boolean
Get list of doctypes this document can be converted to (convert_to)

shortlink
boolean
Return shortened URL instead of regular links

max_clicks
integer
Shortlink max clicks.

Default:
30
expire_days
integer
Shortlink expiration days.

Default:
30
lang
string
Language for pdf link.

Default:
he

Responses
200
OK

